  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">바이브 코딩에 처음으로 도전하였습니다.<br>&#160;<br>1. 혈액순환 시뮬레이션 을 완성하였습니다.<br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/344\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/344</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/344\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=evuJ&amp;datanum=344\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/344\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/344\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>2. 김정식 수석님의 플랫폼에 공유하였습니다.<br><a href=\"https://padlet.com/shngwasoo/padlet-3z067p0oe1z1saqo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://padlet.com/shngwasoo/padlet-3z067p0oe1z1saqo</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"인공지능 바이브 코딩 과학 공유방\" data-og-description=\"Padlet으로 만듦\" data-og-host=\"padlet.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://padlet.com/shngwasoo/padlet-3z067p0oe1z1saqo\" data-og-url=\"https://padlet.com/shngwasoo/padlet-3z067p0oe1z1saqo\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/btNB8x/hyZLBd6ybF/lhLW4nYouaIusr0S92JOpK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cz8bcM/hyZKD5HuCN/YWCjChfTGsNK11faVjmXG0/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=675&amp;face=0_0_1200_675\"><a href=\"https://padlet.com/shngwasoo/padlet-3z067p0oe1z1saqo\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://padlet.com/shngwasoo/padlet-3z067p0oe1z1saqo\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/btNB8x/hyZLBd6ybF/lhLW4nYouaIusr0S92JOpK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cz8bcM/hyZKD5HuCN/YWCjChfTGsNK11faVjmXG0/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=675&amp;face=0_0_1200_675\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">인공지능 바이브 코딩 과학 공유방</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Padlet으로 만듦</p><p class=\"og-host\">padlet.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>3. 김정식 수석님이<br>제 작품의 개선사항을 수정해서 다시 만들어주셨습니다~<br>&#160;<br><i>노트북에서는&#160;재생&#160;버튼이&#160;안&#160;보입니다.&#160;화면을&#160;위아래로&#160;이동하게&#160;하거나,&#160;재생버튼을&#160;위쪽에&#160;두면&#160;좋겠네요.&#160;^^ </i><br><i>추가로 아래 처럼 요구해서 만들어 본 결과물 입니다.</i><br><i> </i><br><b><i>&#39;화면이 위 아래로 스크롤 되게 수정해 주고, 기본 옵션이 혈액순환이 기본 옵션으로 해 줘&#39;</i></b><br>&#160;<br>수정된 작품입니다.<br><a href=\"https://g.co/gemini/share/7966f81a241e\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://g.co/gemini/share/7966f81a241e</a><br>&#160;<br>&#160;어떻게 제 작품을 수정했는지 여쭈니 화면 우측 하단의<b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\"> &#39;Canvas 복사&#39;</span></b>를 눌러<br>원하는 내용으로 수정하면 된다고 하네요.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48b9375aa91f953fda48dab1178da30cece21025\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"533\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48b9375aa91f953fda48dab1178da30cece21025\" data-origin-width=\"1337\" data-origin-height=\"807\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>4.&#160; 그렇다면 오호~<br>&#160;다른 선생님들이 이미 만든 작품도 내 취향대로 바꿀 수 있는 거군요!<br>&#160;(잘 차려놓은 밥상에 숟가락만 얹기^^)<br>&#160;<br>5. 그래서~<br>김정식 수석님이 만든 멘델 유전 법칙(독립의 법칙) + 학습지 활동 추가 도전!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22b05684f27e54e8381ef74ce44a441cbe5d963f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"625\" height=\"433\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22b05684f27e54e8381ef74ce44a441cbe5d963f\" data-origin-width=\"1000\" data-origin-height=\"693\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/5f003d109ee7\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/5f003d109ee7</a><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 86.0379%; height: 351px;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 315px;\"><td style=\"width: 100.0%; height: 315px; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e8f65a5b37da066983e69bfee3f213cc070e02d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"426\" height=\"261\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e8f65a5b37da066983e69bfee3f213cc070e02d\" data-origin-width=\"544\" data-origin-height=\"333\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 100.0%; height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2d66a0ff3274bdd64acd2d85852641cd3231c06\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"548\" height=\"280\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2d66a0ff3274bdd64acd2d85852641cd3231c06\" data-origin-width=\"791\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 100.0%; height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/841c39be4cbaff2d38160d2eb697458ed2282648\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/841c39be4cbaff2d38160d2eb697458ed2282648\" data-origin-width=\"573\" data-origin-height=\"373\"></div><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bbdeb0181cc7f1d1e7c4c93194a2123a5e3c847c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bbdeb0181cc7f1d1e7c4c93194a2123a5e3c847c\" data-origin-width=\"929\" data-origin-height=\"443\"></div><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #409D00;\">6. 드디어 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #409D00;\">&#160; &#160;김정식 + 김영학의 협업 작품 탄생!</span></b><br><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/e7368c6e1c0e\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/e7368c6e1c0e</a><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>앞으로<br>재과만 선생님들의<br>다양한 바이브 협업 작품들을 기대해봅니다~</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
